    {
      "fileName": "flinging-shove.json",
      "id": "d6Vb8D9yOX93mdUI",
      "name": "Flinging Shove",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "d6Vb8D9yOX93mdUI",
        "folder": "SfCEEVMYOlucYEYb",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Flinging Shove",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Whether you're shoving opponents with a shield or a large weapon, you've learned to push them even further. Increase the distance you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove] your opponent with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Aggressive Block] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Brutish Shove] to 10 feet on a success or 20 feet on a critical success. When you use Aggressive Block, you can choose whether the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] or Shoved. When you make a Brutish Shove, you also Shove the target 5 feet on a failure.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 12
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Aggressive Block or Brutish Shove"
              }
            ]
          },
