            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your weapon whirls and darts, striking foes whenever the slightest opening or moment of weakness presents itself. You can use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dueling Riposte] even if you aren't benefiting from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dueling Parry] (though you must be wielding a single one-handed weapon and nothing else). At the start of each of your turns, you gain an additional reaction that you can use only to make a Dueling Riposte.</p>"
          },
