            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a melee weapon.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your body coiled to strike, you can lash out at distant enemies. While you are in this stance, you can use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Reactive Strike] against a creature that is outside your reach but within the reach you would have with a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Lunge]. If you do, you increase your range with the Strike by 5 feet.</p>"
